      "attestations": [
        {
          "text": "LIANG T'ing-nan 梁廷枏 (T. 章冉, H. 藤花亭主人), 1796–1861, scholar, was a native of Shun-tê, Kwangtung. He lost his father at an early age, but was left with independent means. During the first half of his life he devoted himself to academic studies and to the writing of plays.",
          "source": "eccp-3643702",
